By default, read-only MCP tools require user confirmation in Plan Mode. You can

use

`toolAnnotations` and the `mcpName` wildcard to customize this behavior for

your specific environment.

```
~/.gemini/policies/mcp-read-only.toml
```

For more information on how the policy engine works, see the [policy engine](/docs/reference/policy-engine) docs.

##### Example: Allow git commands in Plan Mode


